 her childhood friends, first year student Akari Akaza is finally reunited with second years Yui Funami and Kyouko Toshinou at their all-girls' middle school. During the duo's first year, Yui and Kyouko formed the \"Amusement Club\" which occupies the now nonexistent Tea Club's room. Shortly after Akari joins, one of her fellow classmates, Chinatsu Yoshikawa, pays the trio a visit under the impression that they are the Tea Club; it is only once the three girls explain that the Tea Club has been disbanded that they can convince Chinatsu to join the Amusement Club—a group with no purpose other than to provide entertainment for its members.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Yuri","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Meta","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":52,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"YuruYuri","english":"YuruYuri","native":"ゆるゆり","romaji":"Yuru Yuri","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"摇曳百合"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"YuruYuri: Happy Go Lily"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"轻松百合"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"轻百合"}]},"trailer":{"id":"T_WOMFl7Bd8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/T_WOMFl7Bd8/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}